{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "FR/EN phrase -> expected tool calls (PLAN 6.8). Editor cases run on one 16x16 texture (fixture = image name); navigation cases run on a selection of textures (fixture = selection name, see evalSelection in src/main/services/ai/eval/report.ts); creation cases run on a whole pack (fixture = pack name, see evalPack in the same file; \"sample_datapack\" is a data pack for write_json cases).",
  "cases": [
    {
